Bind Npc 31702 Zone 73 for karus
Bind Npc 31703 Zone 73 for elmorad
Quest 596 "[Great Battle] Two Dogs Fight For a Bone, and a Third Runs Away With It"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Priest] Mazal at the Stronghold of Ronark Land."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Priest] Maia at the Stronghold of Ronark Land."

Requires player level >= 67 and quest 595 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "We need to ask [Priest]Majal to make a peace treaty with the other nation."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We need to ask [Priest]Maia to make a peace treaty with the other nation."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I'll be waiting for you."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "A peace treaty. Okay, I will try to help you but you <selfname> have to go to your castle and get me some information\n\nI think that Ruler[Bres] has made a contract with the devil and plans to take over. You need to let your castle know about this!\n\nConversation with [Priest]Majal greater Ronark Land Base base ."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I'll be waiting for you."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "A peace treaty. Okay, I will try to help you but you <selfname> have to go to your castle and get me some information\n\nI think that Ruler[Bres] has made a contract with the devil and plans to take over. You need to let your castle know about this!\n\nConversation with [Priest]Maia greater Ronark Land Base base ."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "[Captain]Harugo is in the main castle so you'll find him there."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "[Captain]Falkwine is in the main castle so you'll find him there."
